9vj|n|A thing not directly aimed at; something which is a secondary object of regard; an object by the way, etc.; as in on or upon the bye, i. e., in passing; indirectly; by implication. ; A run made upon a missed ball; as, to steal a bye. ; A dwelling. ; In certain games, a station or place of an individual player.	n:9vj,152,9~9vj,152,9	N:9vj,152,9~9vj,152,9
